Antes de mais nada, tente instalar esses pacotes primeiro:

sudo apt-get install -y build-essential gobjc gobjc++ \  gobjc-multilib
gobjc++-multilib gfortran-multilib \  gcc-multilib g++-multilib automake
autoconf gawk \  openmpi-common openmpi-checkpoint libopenmpi1.6
libopenmpi-dev \  libsprng2 libsprng2-dev pvm pvm-dev unixodbc unixodbc-bin
\  gdal-bin libgdal1-dev libproj-dev

Depois configure e rode o make. Se der erro poste aqui novamente.



